<title>USA: General DataComm Q4 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>General DataComm Q4 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDLEBURY, Conn. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended  Twelve months ended</p>
<p>			     September 30,	  September 30,</p>
<p>				 1996	1995	 1996	1995</p>
